  "description": "Expert in size and spec, the Race Lite Expert model is ready to take on growing and evolving racers. Built around a 6061 alloy frame with integrated head tube and chain adjusters, the Expert also sports a 100% chromoly fork, expert rise alloy handlebars, 170mm 3 piece alloy race cranks and sealed bearings throughout the alloy wheel set and bottom bracket. All this adds up to expert performance and handling.\n6061 series smooth weld alloy frame with integrated head tube, internal cable routing, 3D dropouts with integrated chain tensioners\n100% chromoly fork\nAlloy bars and Haro CNC alloy front load stem\n3-piece alloy race cranks with sealed Euro BB\nFully sealed wheels with double wall alloy rims, a sealed rear cassette hub and alloy nipples\nKenda Kontact tires\nPromax V-Brake and lever",
